      <abstract id="cms.Summary">
        <title>Summary</title>
        <p>The purpose of this overview is to:</p>
        <p><list list-type="order"><list-item><label>1</label><p>Briefly describe the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="cms.Clinical_Characteristics_of_Congenit">clinical characteristics</xref> of CMS;</p></list-item><list-item><label>2</label><p>Review the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="cms.Subtypes_and_Genetic_Causes_of_Conge">subtypes and genetic causes</xref> of CMS;</p></list-item><list-item><label>3</label><p>Review the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="cms.Differential_Diagnosis_of_Congenital">differential diagnosis</xref> of CMS;</p></list-item><list-item><label>4</label><p>Provide an <xref ref-type="sec" rid="cms.Evaluation_Strategies_to_Identify_th">evaluation strategy</xref> to identify the genetic cause of CMS in a proband;</p></list-item><list-item><label>5</label><p>Review <xref ref-type="sec" rid="cms.Management">management</xref> of CMS following diagnosis: evaluations, treatment (based on genetic cause when possible) and surveillance;</p></list-item><list-item><label>6</label><p>Inform <xref ref-type="sec" rid="cms.Genetic_Counseling">genetic counseling</xref> of family members of a proband with CMS.</p></list-item></list>
</p>
      </abstract>
